${architecture_diagram}

## Output example

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class User {
        +id: Long
        +username: String
        +email: String
        +status: String "ACTIVE, INACTIVE"
        +password: String
        +createBy: String
        +updateBy: String
        +createTime: Date
        +updateTime: Date

    }

    class Product {
        +id: Long
        +name: String
        +description: String
        +price: Float
        +createBy: String
        +updateBy: String
        +createTime: Date
        +updateTime: Date
    }

    class Order {
        +id: Long
        +userId: String
        +orderDate: DateTime
        +totalAmount: Float
        +createBy: String
        +updateBy: String
        +createTime: Date
        +updateTime: Date
    }

    class Payment {
        +id: Long
        +orderId: String
        +amount: Float
        +paymentDate: DateTime
        +createBy: String
        +updateBy: String
        +createTime: Date
        +updateTime: Date
    }

    User --> Order : places >
    Order --> Product : contains >
    Order o--> Payment : has >
```